module Tests
match Builtin.syscallClockGettime(-1) with | Error e -> e == (if Stdlib.Cli.Posix.__abiMac() then 78 else 22) | Ok _ -> false = true
Stdlib.DateTime.__monotonicMilliseconds() > 0 = true
Stdlib.DateTime.__sleepNanoseconds(0, 0) = Ok ()
Stdlib.DateTime.__sleepNanoseconds(0, -1) = Error 22
Stdlib.DateTime.__realtimeNanoseconds() |> Stdlib.Result.map(fun pair -> let (seconds, nanos) = pair in seconds > 1700000000 && nanos >= 0 && nanos < 1000000000) = Ok true
Stdlib.DateTime.__sleepWith((fun seconds _ -> if seconds == 1 then (-4, Stdlib.Bytes.fromList([0uy, 0uy, 0uy, 0uy, 0uy, 0uy, 0uy, 0uy, 0uy, 0uy, 0uy, 0uy, 0uy, 0uy, 0uy, 0uy])) else (0, Stdlib.Bytes.empty)), 1, 0) = Ok ()
